# Route: guide 34 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 42 quests, 1.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Orgrimmar, Azshara): The Mor'shan Rampart -> The Merchant
# Coast -> Ratchet -> The Mor'shan Rampart -> The Crossroads -> Ratchet ->
# Honor's Stand -> Ratchet -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar ->
# Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Ravencrest Monument.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Shadowshard Fragments (7068;
# Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer
# 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars
# (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974),
# Returning the Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies
# (5728), Slaying the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes
# (95697), Changing Tastes (95697).

